{
  "packetver": 20190605,
  "comment": [
    "Hand-maintained supplement for the 2019 opcode length registry.",
    "The generator fills every opcode that has a `DEFINE_PACKET_HEADER` plus a matching",
    "`PACKET_*` struct. This file covers the packets that rAthena does not define as a",
    "struct at PACKETVER 20190605:",
    "  * the hand-rolled char-server packets (char_clif.cpp writes them with WFIFO*),",
    "  * the dynamic `enum packet_headers` opcodes (spawn/skill-unit/party/...),",
    "  * packets that are sent with literal opcodes from clif.cpp.",
    "Each `size`/`base_size` was verified against the server source; when a struct name is",
    "given, the generator resolves the size with the same sizeof() probe as the generated",
    "entries (and fails if the struct does not exist)."
  ],
